---
name: test-engineering
description: "Plan, design, implement where applicable, execute, and evaluate V&V that produces objective evidence a realized system satisfies requirements and intended use. Use when selecting analysis, inspection, demonstration, test, or evaluation with required evidence and pass/fail. Use when a change needs a V&V method. Do not write product tests until method is test; then hand off to write-tests. Do not use for lineup or model choice, RS publication, hook-path invention, ordinary review, or as a write-tests stand-in."
type: agent-skill
title: Test Engineering
